  "details": "q3, beefy pcvr.\n\nUsed to play with small nameplates, with the new UI even Tiny option seems like a middle choice, barely small enough.\n\nSo imo nameplate size needs a proper 5-500% slider or something, not 5 options that don't even match older version in sizes.\n\nAlso with it set to Tiny, the rest of the nameplate suffers, like I physically cannot read the download size on avatar's loading bar.\n\nSo please add adjustability and test every part of nameplate, I understand that standalone q3 is less resolution and needs more scale, I, in turn want nameplates to barely exist without turning them off. Thank you.",
